# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_Q80SU6> (sodium-dependent phosphate transport protein 2C (mouse))

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "OMA:Q80SU6") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PRO:DNx") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_Q80SU6> "A sodium-dependent phosphate transport protein 2C that is encoded in the genome of mouse.")
